  "title": "Cowboy Stew II",
  "description": "I learned this recipe in the Boy Scouts and it is the perfect recipe for guys living on their own. It&#39;s quick and easy and very difficult to mess up. If you have a slow cooker, let it stew for a day or so. You&#39;ll be ready to go out and herd cattle after eating this!",
